on my AS2100, there are two vertical columns of drive slots.  I've only got
8 drives, so I put 7 into the right column, and 1 into the left.  I
plugged the scsi cable coming from the right column into the mylex card,
and plugged the cable coming from the left column into the I/O expansion
board.

